# Refactoring guide

## Goal

Break pages into reusable components and unify styling from `app.css` and `src/lib/styles/`. See `todo.md` for the full backlog.

**Consolidation status:** Complete for phases 1–2 (marketing pages + home). Remaining deferred work is `designguide` redesign only.

Current priorities:

1. **Deferred: `designguide`** — keep page-local until a future docs-style redesign; do not block other work
2. **Experiment page** — `experiment/+page.svelte` demos shared components; extend when adding new primitives
3. **Non-consolidation backlog** — see medium/low items in `todo.md` (lang toggle, text backgrounds, nav polish, etc.)

Done: typography option A + unified text tokens; text container (`PageContent` = `.text-width`, `PageShell` single width); Surface panels on om-mandalon / konsulttjanster; site chrome / `ParagraphArray` folder moves; `PageHeader` and `PageShell` on phase-1 pages; home phase 2 (`HeroSection`, `FeatureCarousel`, `SalesIntroSection`); `Table` + paketering capabilities; `Button`; layout utilities in `layout.css`; experiment lab expanded; `--container-width-narrow` removed from `app.css` (designguide width quarantined page-locally).

Component structure, WIP status, and extraction rules: see `svelte-components.mdc`.

