## Workflow for each task

1. Pick **one page or one pattern** (not the whole site)
2. Identify existing components/classes that already match the target look
3. Refactor the **canonical page** (Swedish slug, e.g. `paketering/+page.svelte`) — locale wrappers stay untouched
4. Run `npm run format`, then `npm run check` and `npm run lint`
5. Verify visually in the browser
6. Update `todo.md` when done

## Refactoring rules

- **Preserve behavior** — i18n, SEO meta, hreflang, links, and all copy from `src/lib/content/site.js` must stay intact
- **Minimal scope** — do not refactor unrelated pages or rename routes
- **Reuse first** — extend existing components before creating new ones
- **No copy in components** — text stays in `siteContent` / `data.content`; components receive props
- **Unify visuals** — follow the one-visual-treatment principle in `product-design.mdc`

